## Vibe Coding Ki Common Mistakes Aur Unse Kaise Bachein

### Mistake 1: Har Problem Ke Liye Naya Prompt Dena

Jab application mein bug aata hai, kuch users poora project regenerate karwa dete hain. Isse working features break ho sakte hain aur code unnecessarily complex ban sakta hai.

**Better approach:** Existing implementation inspect karein, smallest relevant fix identify karein aur changes ko version control mein track karein.

### Mistake 2: AI Output Ko Blindly Trust Karna

AI nonexistent functions, incorrect API usage, outdated patterns ya incomplete error handling generate kar sakta hai.

**Better approach:** Documentation verify karein, application run karein aur tests execute karein. Important code paths manually review karein.

### Mistake 3: Security Ko End Mein Yaad Karna

Agar application mein customer information, payments ya personal records hain, security ko final polishing task nahi banana chahiye.

**Better approach:** Requirements stage par hi authentication, authorisation, data retention aur privacy expectations define karein.

### Mistake 4: Unnecessary Dependencies Add Karna

AI kabhi-kabhi simple requirement ke liye bhi additional libraries introduce kar sakta hai. Har dependency maintenance, compatibility aur security review ka extra work laati hai.

**Better approach:** Prompt mein specify karein ki existing libraries reuse hon aur new dependencies add karne se pehle reason explain kiya jaaye.

### Mistake 5: Prototype Ko Production-Ready Samajhna

Prototype demo ke liye useful ho sakta hai, lekin production product ko performance, reliability, monitoring, backups aur support requirements meet karni padti hain.

**Better approach:** Deployment se pehle explicit release checklist aur risk review complete karein.

### Mistake 6: Code Samjhe Bina Critical Product Ship Karna

Agar application business revenue, customer records ya operational decisions handle karti hai, toh undocumented code aur unverified AI changes significant risk create kar sakte hain.

**Better approach:** Har important feature ke liye samjhein ki data kahan store hota hai, permissions kaise work karti hain aur failure ke case mein kya hota hai. High-impact applications mein experienced developer review arrange karein.

