## Vibe Coding Ke Real-World Use Cases

### 1. Freelancers Ke Liye

Freelancer client meeting se pehle landing page ka working prototype create kar sakta hai. Client design aur flow par feedback de sakta hai, jisse full implementation se pehle expectations clear ho sakti hain.

Lekin prototype aur final deliverable ke scope, hosting, maintenance aur support terms clear rakhein.

### 2. Students Aur Beginners Ke Liye

Students AI se small projects build karte hue programming fundamentals seekh sakte hain. Agar AI generated code ka explanation deta hai, toh student usse use karke functions, components aur state management understand kar sakta hai.

Best learning practice yeh hai ki generated code ko line-by-line inspect karein, phir kuch changes khud implement karne ki koshish karein.

### 3. Startup Founders Ke Liye

Founders product idea test karne ke liye basic MVP create kar sakte hain. Early users se feedback milne ke baad decide kiya ja sakta hai ki product mein aur investment karni chahiye ya nahi.

Lekin MVP ko production product mein convert karte waqt architecture, scalability, data integrity aur maintenance requirements reassess karni chahiye.

### 4. Small Businesses Ke Liye

AI-assisted development se internal dashboards, enquiry forms aur simple reporting interfaces create karna practical ho sakta hai.

Business-critical workflows ko automate karne se pehle existing process document karein aur failure cases test karein. Inventory, invoicing ya customer data ke liye reliable storage aur backup strategy especially important hai.

