## Vibe Coding Ke Pros Aur Cons: Balanced View

### Advantages

- **Faster prototyping:** Initial implementation aur design exploration accelerate ho sakti hai.
- **Lower entry barrier:** Non-experts ideas ko working prototypes mein convert karna start kar sakte hain.
- **Learning support:** Code explanations aur examples se unfamiliar concepts samajhne mein help mil sakti hai.
- **Rapid iteration:** UI variations aur feature ideas test karna easier ho sakta hai.
- **Developer productivity:** Boilerplate, repetitive changes aur test drafts mein assistance mil sakti hai.

### Limitations

- **Incorrect output:** Generated code plausible dikhne ke bawajood wrong ho sakta hai.
- **Debugging complexity:** Large AI-generated changes ka root cause identify karna difficult ho sakta hai.
- **Security risks:** Vulnerabilities, unsafe defaults ya secret exposure possible hain.
- **Maintenance burden:** Poor architecture future development slow kar sakti hai.
- **Tool dependency:** Pricing, usage limits, integrations aur platform restrictions workflow affect kar sakte hain.
- **Skill gaps:** Coding fundamentals ke bina generated code ki quality evaluate karna difficult hota hai.

Balanced conclusion simple hai: AI development ko easier bana sakta hai, lekin good software engineering ke principles ko eliminate nahi karta.

