## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)

### 1. Kya Vibe Coding Ke Liye Programming Aana Zaroori Hai?

Basic prototypes start karne ke liye advanced programming knowledge mandatory nahi hai, especially jab aap beginner-friendly AI tools use kar rahe hon. Lekin debugging, data handling aur production software ke liye programming fundamentals kaafi useful hain.

Aap HTML, CSS, JavaScript, HTTP requests, databases aur basic security concepts step-by-step seekh sakte hain.

### 2. Kya AI Se Complete Website Ban Sakti Hai?

AI-assisted tools website ka layout, frontend components aur kuch backend functionality generate kar sakte hain. Result requirements aur tool capabilities par depend karega.

Production website ke liye responsive design, accessibility, security, SEO, performance, content accuracy aur testing bhi required hain.

### 3. Kya Vibe Coding Free Hai?

Kuch tools limited free access ya trial provide kar sakte hain, jabki advanced features paid plans mein available ho sakte hain. Model usage, cloud hosting, databases aur third-party APIs additional cost create kar sakte hain.

Start karne se pehle current pricing aur usage limits check karein. Free access ko unlimited usage assume na karein.

### 4. Kya Vibe Coding Developers Ki Jobs Replace Kar Degi?

AI coding assistants development workflow ko change kar rahe hain, lekin unki capabilities aur limitations task ke according vary karti hain.

Requirements analysis, architecture, debugging, security, code review aur stakeholder communication jaise tasks mein engineering judgement important hai. Developers ke liye AI tools ko effectively use karna aur generated output evaluate karna valuable skill ho sakta hai.

### 5. Vibe Coding Ke Liye Best AI Tool Kaun Sa Hai?

Ek universal best tool nahi hai.

- Existing codebase ke liye Cursor ya GitHub Copilot consider karein.
- Browser-based prototyping ke liye Replit Agent explore karein.
- Code reasoning aur debugging ke liye Claude evaluate karein.
- Frontend interface generation ke liye v0 consider karein.

Final decision apne project, budget, coding experience aur privacy requirements ke basis par lein.

### 6. Kya AI-Generated App Ko Directly Deploy Kar Sakte Hain?

Technically deployment possible ho sakta hai, lekin bina testing aur review ke deploy karna advisable nahi hai.

Build checks, functional tests, security review, environment configuration aur backup requirements complete karne ke baad hi application release karein. Customer data ya payments handle karne wale products ke liye qualified technical review especially important hai.

### 7. Kya Vibe Coding Se Mobile Apps Bhi Ban Sakti Hain?

Haan, AI-assisted tools mobile-friendly web apps aur supported mobile development frameworks ke projects create karne mein help kar sakte hain.

Lekin web application aur native mobile application ki requirements different ho sakti hain. Device permissions, offline support, app-store guidelines aur platform-specific testing ko separately handle karna pad sakta hai.

